    {
      "id": "C-CAPABILITY-BACKED",
      "kind": "claim_backed",
      "charges": "R_CAPABILITY",
      "fail_mode": "closed",
      "scope": "authority",
      "select": ["_registry/acquire-capabilities.json"],
      "pointer": "/stages/*",
      "flag": "implemented",
      "id_field": "id",
      "backing": "_skill/engines/acquire.py",
      "pattern": "status[\"stages\"][\"{id}\"]",
      "missing_ok": true,
      "why": "C-CAPABILITY-COMPLETE reads hand-written flags, so it can only count claims, never test them -- X6 read implemented=true for weeks while run() had no caller at all. This case makes the ledger falsifiable: every stage flagged implemented must write its own status row in the engine. Closed, because a ledger that overstates the code is worse than one that admits a gap. NOT_APPLICABLE on a seat that has no acquire.py."
    },
    {
      "id": "C-ACQUIRE-MODEL-FREE",
      "kind": "json_probe",
      "charges": "R_SEMANTICS",
      "fail_mode": "closed",
      "scope": "authority",
      "select": ["_registry/acquire-capabilities.json"],
      "pointer": "/capabilities/*/needs_model",
      "expect": "all_in",
      "values": [false],
      "missing_ok": false,
      "why": "acquisition_is_never_a_model_job as a probe instead of as prose. Every row in this file's own capability map is an acquire.* capability -- the model-consuming ones (asr, vision, text) are inherited by reference under one-writer-per-provider-list and are not written here -- so a true value means a model was placed on the path that turns a URL into raw bits, which is exactly what the rule forbids. It is also the enforceable half of model_output_as_query: a model may say WHERE to look only because the fetch that follows is deterministic and measured downstream. Closed, because a model inside acquisition makes every fact after it unmeasured. Known limit, stated rather than hidden: a capability row that omits needs_model entirely is not caught, because a wildcard pointer collects only the values that resolve -- the same gap C-CAPABILITY-DECLARED carries for stages. Catching an absent key needs a new case kind, which is code, so it is recorded as residual instead of being faked here."
    },
